; DNS zone file for dhermi.boats
; Target: GitHub Pages repository paulreginaphoto/dhermi-boats
; Use this when moving the domain away from the old WordPress-hosted site.
;
; IMPORTANT:
; - Remove old WordPress.com A records such as 192.0.78.153 and 192.0.78.206.
; - Do not create a wildcard record like *.dhermi.boats.
; - Keep any existing MX/TXT/SPF/DKIM records if domain email is configured.
; - In the GitHub repo Pages settings, the custom domain must be set to dhermi.boats.
; - When the domain is connected, the repo build should use:
;     NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=
;     NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_ORIGIN=https://dhermi.boats

$ORIGIN dhermi.boats.
$TTL 3600

@ IN SOA ns1.wordpress.com. hostmaster.wordpress.com. (
  2026052201 ; serial: increment whenever this zone changes
  3600       ; refresh
  900        ; retry
  1209600    ; expire
  3600       ; minimum TTL
)

; If the domain continues to use WordPress.com DNS management, keep these.
; If the registrar uses different authoritative nameservers, replace these NS lines
; with the registrar/DNS provider's real nameservers.
@ IN NS ns1.wordpress.com.
@ IN NS ns2.wordpress.com.
@ IN NS ns3.wordpress.com.

; Apex domain: dhermi.boats -> GitHub Pages
@ IN A 185.199.108.153
@ IN A 185.199.109.153
@ IN A 185.199.110.153
@ IN A 185.199.111.153

; IPv6 support for GitHub Pages
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8000::153
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8001::153
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8002::153
@ IN AAAA 2606:50c0:8003::153

; www subdomain. Do not include /dhermi-boats here.
www IN CNAME paulreginaphoto.github.io.
